  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">B4D consultancy study Tetra</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">B4D konsultinsats Tetra</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tetra Pak and one of their cooperation partners in Bangladesh have suggest a programme in order to establish a number of dairy hubs with the aim to improve quality of the milk, increase the incomes for small milk farmers. In order to make a fair assessment Sida has assigned an expert, who will travel to Bangladesh in order to give an expert assessment.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tetra Pak inkom med ett projektf&#xF6;rslag d&#xE4;r de skulle samfinansiera uppr&#xE4;ttandet av ett antal mj&#xF6;lkproduktionscenter i Bangladesh tillsammans med sin st&#xF6;rsta kund i landet. F&#xF6;r att f&#xE5; kvalificerat underlag f&#xF6;r att kunna bed&#xF6;ma huruvida insatsen &#xE4;r relevant har Sida uppdragit &#xE5;t en expert att g&#xF6;ra en resa och titta p&#xE5; uppl&#xE4;gget, kvalit&#xE9; etc.</narrative>
  </description>
